              "Phase 2: S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng combo chung \u1EDF tr\xEAn nh\u01B0ng l\u01B0u \xFD d\xF9ng 5 - 4 \u0111\u1EC3 Focus/Taunt m\u1ED7i khi h\u1ED3i v\xE0 kh\xF4ng s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng Potion. L\u01B0u \xFD k\xEDch l\u1EA1i 4 sau khi b\u1ECB Kolr x\xF3a Aura \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3 l\u1EA1i th\u1EE7, Heal v\xE0 Focus/Taunt.",
              "Phase 3 v\xE0 4: Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC l\u01B0u \xFD, \u0111\xE1nh b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng theo combo.",
              "Phase 5: Trong 3s \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EE7a Phase n\xE0y c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA7y m\xE1u (tr\u1EE3 gi\xFAp t\u1EEB LoO v\xE0 t\u1EEB skill 4 b\u1EA3n th\xE2n), sau \u0111\xF3 ch\xFA \xFD th\u1EA5y m\xE1u b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EE5t th\xEC k\xEDch 5 - 4 \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EB7n DMG gi\xFAp t\u0103ng kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng tr\u1EE5 s\xE2n. Sau \u0111\xF3 d\xF9ng skill nh\u01B0 th\u01B0\u1EDDng.",
